      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，她们俩日后铁定能回归赛场！\n然后应该能再度跑出像“日本德比”那样\n无与伦比的精彩对决！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffae55ca5d7c64d8ef20466a136fa35e1bce2cdb4997fca135452d4617667476",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
