    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7bff4f70d036cdd35cb3f033",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，阿尔丹前辈拥有追逐“梦想”的热情！\n于是我告诉她，\n就算她不相信自己，我也会相信她！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8854e05e1e8d8df22ebd2e74a93111452e4d6bbf3163c4ab01594255e2afd02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1053/storytimeline_501053404.json",
      "json_path": [
