      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有消息指出，\n小栗前辈将要参加“安田纪念”！！\n居然能在我擅长的距离和她一战，太开心了！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "098fc404653b1e57f41a75935cec10f29e3e9ed076bfaac605d407dd18fe4050",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
