      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而八重也会参加这场“安田纪念”！！\n终于能跑一场“梦想”中的精彩对决，\n使我感到雀跃无比，但──",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cc608829912797f92182dc128013ee79c46344cac1667707573b518fb113636",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
