      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重却留下一句──\n“小栗可能一并吞噬你的‘梦想’”，\n之后就跑掉了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a1b4b4e63b463625665b3c1dd28d676af5b8ee2b2badf3bb8d4ddab0177e71f",
