      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来训练员告诉我，八重或许是看到\n小栗前辈在各种距离取胜的活跃表现，\n因而丧失了信心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "63cd4c9d4c7b6d31aad2311e5f8d6f0fcbf3741a40617ca14e373601fe30c106",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
