      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，我就要让八重看看我挺身挑战的模样！\n借此告诉她，小栗前辈才不是什么\n会吞噬别人“梦想”的存在……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ddbdcaf8e3ab6031aada72bcec44bf29fa2dfd9b8275ab577eeac3564878178",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
