    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e888f8a30f3b7283f796eac6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”……唔～～～！！\n听起来超美妙的啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7706a772b3c3c99fbdcf488c604c52a94c46e506d62ded275bf5ba88f92c2a3",
